source "Kconfig.zephyr"

config TT_D2D_TEST_TRAIN
	bool "Build the two-die link training suite instead of the loader suite"
	help
	  The loader suite runs on a single die. Training needs a second die
	  running the other end of the link, so the two cannot share a run:
	  the loader tests leave the tile loaded and started, which is not
	  where training wants to begin. Selecting this builds an image that
	  trains the link and nothing else.

config TT_D2D_TEST_TRAIN_KERAUNOS
	bool "Train the Mimir1-to-Keraunos link as well"
	depends on TT_D2D_TEST_TRAIN
	help
	  Build the Mimir image for an MMK package rather than an MM one.
	  Keraunos adds a second link, from its D2D2 to Mimir1's D2D1, which
	  makes Mimir1 the die in the middle with a tile at each end. Without
	  this Mimir1 brings up only the tile facing Mimir0, and Keraunos0's
	  end of the second link would wait for a partner that never loads.

	  Has no effect on the Keraunos image, which exists only in a package
	  that has one.
